* body808 models: piezo disc, 1N4733A and BZX55C5V1 zeners, ATmega2560 analog pin.
* See sim/README.md for where the values come from.

* --- 27 mm piezo disc, Butterworth-Van Dyke model ---------------------------
* red black: the disc's leads. force: hit force as a voltage (1 V = 1 unit),
* drives the motional branch, so the ringing comes out of the model itself.
* C0 static capacitance (datasheets: 16-20 nF, +-30 %), CM motional
* capacitance (~C0/10 for buzzer discs), F mechanical resonance, Q quality
* factor (bare disc ~90, glued to a plate and padded: lower).
.subckt PIEZO red black force C0=20n CM=2n F=4.6k Q=30
.param LM={1/((6.283185307*F)**2*CM)}
.param RM={sqrt(LM/CM)/Q}
C0 red black {C0}
RM red m1 {RM}
LM m1 m2 {LM}
CM m2 m3 {CM}
EF m3 black force 0 1
.ends PIEZO

* --- 1N4733A zener, 5.1 V 1 W (the 1N4728A-1N4756A kit) ---------------------
* Fitted to the datasheet: Vz 5.1 V at Izt 49 mA, Zzt <= 7 ohm, Zzk <= 550 ohm
* at 1 mA, IR <= 10 uA at 1 V. The low-current knee is a typical
* guess (NBV sets its slope), ~4.7 V at 1 mA and ~4.3 V at 10 uA: measure
* yours, see sim/README.md.
.model 1N4733A D(IS=1e-14 N=1 BV=4.98 IBV=49m NBV=3 RS=2.5 CJO=200p M=0.33 VJ=0.75)

* --- BZX55C5V1 zener, 5.1 V 0.5 W (DO-35) ------------------------------------
* Same junction as the 1N4733A on a ~10x smaller die: currents / 10, RS x 10.
* Gives the datasheet's Vz 5.1 V at Izt 5 mA (4.8-5.4 V), Zzt ~41 ohm (max 60).
.model BZX55C5V1 D(IS=1e-15 N=1 BV=4.98 IBV=4.9m NBV=3 RS=25 CJO=60p M=0.33 VJ=0.75)

* --- ATmega2560 analog input pin ------------------------------------------------
* pin vcc gnd. Clamp diodes to VCC and GND (conduct at ~0.6 V past the rails),
* ~10 pF pin capacitance, ADC sample-and-hold: 14 pF behind ~1 kohm (datasheet
* figure "Analog Input Circuitry"). ICLO / ICHI: 0 V sources that measure the
* clamp diode currents, read as v.<instance>.viclo#branch / ...vichi#branch.
.subckt AVRPIN pin vcc gnd
VICLO gnd lo 0
DLO lo pin DCLAMP
VICHI hi vcc 0
DHI pin hi DCLAMP
CPIN pin gnd 10p
RSH pin sh 1k
CSH sh gnd 14p
.model DCLAMP D(IS=1e-14 N=1 RS=20)
.ends AVRPIN
